            "block_content": "M. Teachers shall release students to non-school personnel (including parents) or other unauthorized persons only after being provided with authorization by the principal or his designee. If the teacher makes a reasonable effort to prevent an unauthorized removal of a student, he shall not be subject to disciplinary action.",
